do_1 = "Replace the six callback-less registrations at services/wallet/gateway/test/repair-22-33-181.test.ts:920 and the three at services/wallet/gateway/test/repair-22-33-209.test.ts:601 with test(fn.name, fn, timeout), omitting timeout only for the two cases that currently use the default; preserve all nine named async functions, their assertions, the six 10000 ms budgets and the 60000 ms adapter budget."
do_2 = "Run only the two repair suites against their existing production code paths and committed peers; require the Vitest JSON result to report success, exactly nine total and passed tests, zero failed tests, zero pending tests and zero TODO tests."
